{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wade into the ripples of time, where every move counts and the dream may never let you go.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/e80b5c7c899055dd4c02971e06640dd8.poster.avif?t=1747255759\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/e80b5c7c899055dd4c02971e06640dd8.webm?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/e80b5c7c899055dd4c02971e06640dd8.mp4?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a city adrift in the mist, you find yourself chasing whispers of power and salvation. Time bends to your command\u2014a fleeting grace from the King\u2014but the sand in your hourglass runs thin. Streets shift with every step, revealing new paths and strange opportunities. In this roguelite tactical game, your choices ripple outward, daring you to master the unknown or succumb to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/ea58aad15b8c4b0f12ba7d807756230f.avif?t=1747255759\" width=640 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weave Through Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the King\u2019s grace to travel through time on battlefields. Rewind the timeline, slipping between moments to weave impossible tactics\u2014outmaneuvering foes with strategies that only exist in dreams. Your actions blur the line between reality and possibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/fcf7597359d8b748fccedcefad6c9aec.poster.avif?t=1747255759\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/fcf7597359d8b748fccedcefad6c9aec.webm?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/fcf7597359d8b748fccedcefad6c9aec.mp4?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Foresight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move through time, gain the power of prescience. Predict enemy moves with uncanny precision, setting the stage for synchronized attacks. Master the flow of time and strike in perfect harmony, turning foresight into devastating sequences of triumph\u2014or chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/eabc8b8a46c44df474be84dc9390a528.poster.avif?t=1747255759\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/eabc8b8a46c44df474be84dc9390a528.webm?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/eabc8b8a46c44df474be84dc9390a528.mp4?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate a Shifting City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander streets that realign and transform ahead of you. Each step uncovers new encounters and strange discoveries in a city that is never the same twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/5144404c0f52d5be44edb9265b0b49a2.poster.avif?t=1747255759\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/5144404c0f52d5be44edb9265b0b49a2.webm?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/5144404c0f52d5be44edb9265b0b49a2.mp4?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wager What You Have</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your precious sand and rare jewels as both lifelines and temptations. Use them to push forward, secure critical advantages, or recover from perilous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/d92293b683bbbd8be0f9d4e816a61545.poster.avif?t=1747255759\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/d92293b683bbbd8be0f9d4e816a61545.webm?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/d92293b683bbbd8be0f9d4e816a61545.mp4?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into Endless Possibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each dream anew and face cryptic battles, surreal encounters, and cursed treasures bathed in black sunlight. What lies beyond the next corner? Only those who dare will find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/075035f13cd5ca093b2e207c0f268fef.poster.avif?t=1747255759\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/075035f13cd5ca093b2e207c0f268fef.webm?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/075035f13cd5ca093b2e207c0f268fef.mp4?t=1747255759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lose Yourself in the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mist hides more than streets: answers, horrors, and perhaps even yourself. Echoes of unseen footsteps and whispers of impossible beings accompany your journey, daring you to grasp at the truths the city refuses to reveal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/ea58aad15b8c4b0f12ba7d807756230f.avif?t=1747255759\" width=640 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into <strong>Timelake</strong>, where strategy is your only anchor in a world unmoored by time and madness.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296330?t=1747255759","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296330?t=1747255759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/b5591fd64c602035955176cc72237f6bff9e2481/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747255759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/b5591fd64c602035955176cc72237f6bff9e2481/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747255759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3480810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wade into the ripples of time, where every move counts and the dream may never let you go.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas