 >Lose Yourself in the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mist hides more than streets: answers, horrors, and perhaps even yourself. Echoes of unseen footsteps and whispers of impossible beings accompany your journey, daring you to grasp at the truths the city refuses to reveal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/extras/ea58aad15b8c4b0f12ba7d807756230f.avif?t=1747255759\" width=640 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into <strong>Timelake</strong>, where strategy is your only anchor in a world unmoored by time and madness.</i></p>","developers":["Catenary Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296330/2c0dde2f374e89f71cd0a4cc8125fb8d215b334d/header.jpg?t=1747255759","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Catenary Games\u2122 is a trademark of Catenary Games LLC, registered or pending registration in the United States.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or SteamOS 3 (or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti or equivalent (requires Vulkan support)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA or PulseAudio compatible</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><st